1
00:00:00,695 --> 00:00:02,525
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, they went
back down!

2
00:00:04,666 --> 00:00:08,666
(Raj:)All right, guys, what game
do you want to play?

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,140
(Howard:)Let's see.

4
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:13,538
(Howard:)How about
"Emily or Cinnamon?"

5
00:00:14,809 --> 00:00:16,639
(Raj:)You know what? I think
it's a little weird

6
00:00:16,645 --> 00:00:18,475
(Raj:)that you remember me
saying all these things.

7
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:21,880
(Raj:)Maybe the truth is-- you're
jealous of all my relationships.

8
00:00:22,817 --> 00:00:24,987
(Howard:)Oh, maybe I am.

9
00:00:24,986 --> 00:00:26,516
(Howard:)Who wouldn't want
to be the girl,

10
00:00:26,521 --> 00:00:29,521
(Howard:)or possibly dog,
to hear the words:

11
00:00:29,524 --> 00:00:31,524
"You're so lucky.

12
00:00:31,526 --> 00:00:33,626
(Howard:)You have the
shiniest hair."

13
00:00:37,198 --> 00:00:39,198
(Leonard:)That is a tough one.

14
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,270
Uh, I-I know he brushes
both of them.

15
00:00:43,371 --> 00:00:45,571
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen...
Yeah.

16
00:00:45,574 --> 00:00:48,704
(Sheldon:)I have figured out the perfect
way for you to irritate me.

17
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:52,680
(Sheldon:)I'd like you to be my
intellectual sparring partners.

18
00:00:52,681 --> 00:00:55,051
(Sheldon:)From now on,
when I make an assertion,

19
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,680
(Sheldon:)I need you to challenge it.

20
00:00:56,685 --> 00:00:59,915
(Leonard:)So you just want us to disagree
with whatever you say?

21
00:00:59,921 --> 00:01:01,221
(Sheldon:)Yes.

